{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grocery Store Tycoon - First Store</strong> allows players to take their first steps as a store owner by managing and expanding their very first shop. Start with a small store, optimize its layout, stock shelves efficiently, and serve customers to grow your business. Careful planning and strategic decisions will be key to turning your humble beginning into a thriving supermarket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/4af17b5c06bd7b1662bc0107b18d7414.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/4af17b5c06bd7b1662bc0107b18d7414.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/4af17b5c06bd7b1662bc0107b18d7414.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/4c0a7dd42299041176b108de2b43342b.webp?t=1748897871\" width=235 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate the Cash Register yourself if you would like to challenge the speed of your best cashier, or simply do not want to pay the wage. Swipe as fast as you can to avoid long queue times and unhappy customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/0824d004d4226990a68db3f273f9983a.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/0824d004d4226990a68db3f273f9983a.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/0824d004d4226990a68db3f273f9983a.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/b0d5d93b6170f25aa35d512bca01b2e8.webp?t=1748897871\" width=233 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock Shelves by carrying a case at a time from the warehouse or use a cart to transport larger quantities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/551c3652692f8d6183b4198c75e55da8.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/551c3652692f8d6183b4198c75e55da8.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/551c3652692f8d6183b4198c75e55da8.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/98bc8071c9475bf131a1b379fcfb2fe9.webp?t=1748897871\" width=231 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase Placeables such as Cash Registers, Shelving, Coolers, Freezers, Produce Shelves, Shopping Cart Corrals, Shopping Basket Stands, Material Handling Equipment, and Decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/874c3f73352aa319dec204803a23239f.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/874c3f73352aa319dec204803a23239f.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/874c3f73352aa319dec204803a23239f.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/77634084f83f82e83dc94d31fd3d2908.webp?t=1748897871\" width=236 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive UI to manage your store through customer statistics, supply and demand of goods, pricing adjustments, placeable condition viewing, and employee management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/d2053e01bb645f55e99e1f49a0fc0253.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/d2053e01bb645f55e99e1f49a0fc0253.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/d2053e01bb645f55e99e1f49a0fc0253.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/bc10793c2e72f58341e0d1a3bb6192d3.webp?t=1748897871\" width=237 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Item Types, Placeables, Management Tools, Employee Hiring Capacity, Store Expansions, and the opportunity to purchase other stores by gaining experience passively, by working, or by completing bonus objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/01cc92c263f5431393ae2536036d42e7.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/01cc92c263f5431393ae2536036d42e7.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/01cc92c263f5431393ae2536036d42e7.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/84b60be621a39ec7696c8a4947ac2fd1.webp?t=1748897871\" width=231 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain placeables, return carts and baskets, and keep the store clean to keep your store operating at its full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/ee1e97cb2d045d942e9fa6475b1e3ad2.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/ee1e97cb2d045d942e9fa6475b1e3ad2.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/ee1e97cb2d045d942e9fa6475b1e3ad2.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/024b3ae4f2b89f2e514b7ac025980eea.webp?t=1748897871\" width=237 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Employees to keep them happy or they may quit! Assigning an employee to the job they would like, the wage they want, and not overworking them all contribute to the employee's happiness. Unreliable employees may call in and affect your happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/478114bd07d1eef7798a5a98252efffe.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/478114bd07d1eef7798a5a98252efffe.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/478114bd07d1eef7798a5a98252efffe.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/e81dd7547c75c891af8d8e5968feb114.webp?t=1748897871\" width=232 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers must be satisfied to get good reviews and keep your store in good standing. Having the goods they seek, keeping them in the store for as little time as possible, and  having a charismatic employee behind the cash register all contribute to the satisfaction of customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/2e46e8fe86220fb5cb427f94f043e643.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=