ee management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/d2053e01bb645f55e99e1f49a0fc0253.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/d2053e01bb645f55e99e1f49a0fc0253.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/d2053e01bb645f55e99e1f49a0fc0253.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/bc10793c2e72f58341e0d1a3bb6192d3.webp?t=1748897871\" width=237 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Item Types, Placeables, Management Tools, Employee Hiring Capacity, Store Expansions, and the opportunity to purchase other stores by gaining experience passively, by working, or by completing bonus objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/01cc92c263f5431393ae2536036d42e7.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/01cc92c263f5431393ae2536036d42e7.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/01cc92c263f5431393ae2536036d42e7.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/84b60be621a39ec7696c8a4947ac2fd1.webp?t=1748897871\" width=231 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain placeables, return carts and baskets, and keep the store clean to keep your store operating at its full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/ee1e97cb2d045d942e9fa6475b1e3ad2.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/ee1e97cb2d045d942e9fa6475b1e3ad2.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/ee1e97cb2d045d942e9fa6475b1e3ad2.mp4?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/024b3ae4f2b89f2e514b7ac025980eea.webp?t=1748897871\" width=237 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Employees to keep them happy or they may quit! Assigning an employee to the job they would like, the wage they want, and not overworking them all contribute to the employee's happiness. Unreliable employees may call in and affect your happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/478114bd07d1eef7798a5a98252efffe.poster.avif?t=1748897871\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432530/extras/478114bd07d1eef7798a5a98252efffe.webm?t=1748897871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source s